-    *   Incoming ambient radiance $L_{in}(\boldsymbol{\omega}')$ from all directions $\boldsymbol{\omega}'$ [S2].
-    *   Volume boundary points $x_a$ (entry) and $x_b$ (exit) for the ray passing through $x$ [S2].
